  "painter": "mix",
  "note": "Black obsidian with a molten-gold corona line: OpenAI panels on the whole cue (a glossy black obsidian shaft twisted with black-chrome spiral ribbons and one molten-gold line winding along it, a forearm of twisting obsidian and chrome ribbons veined with molten gold, a black engraved grip with gold cracks, a black sleeve with gold bands), a chrome collar with gold bands, a gold ring, a black end; the molten gold glows. The 3D piece (pieces/eclipse): a floating total eclipse past the butt: a glossy black sphere held by a black cup with gold rings and four slender gold prongs, two thin glowing orbit rings precessing round it, a small cratered silver moon orbiting it, obsidian shards drifting round the mount. The corona is camera-facing particles centred on the sphere, so it sits on its outline from every side.",
